ci_gate check_kernel_ratchet
  stage rust
  description "Five measured ceilings in data/meta/kernel-ratchet.lino may be lowered by a pull request and never raised. This does not claim Rust must shrink: ARCHITECT-VISION.md withdrew that, since Rust is one target the meta language is emitted into and its line count measures an output."
  run "rust-script --test scripts/check-kernel-ratchet.rs && rust-script scripts/check-kernel-ratchet.rs"
